    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is defined for<br /><math><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> or <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br />But <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>…</mo></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br />Also, <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo